Template: ndi-runtime-installer/accept-license
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Do you accept the NDI SDK License Agreement?
 This package downloads the NDI SDK for Linux from ndi.video and installs
 only its runtime library (libndi.so.6). The SDK is proprietary software
 by Vizrt NDI AB; its license is available at:
 .
   http://ndi.link/ndisdk_license
 .
 If you do not accept, nothing is downloaded. You can change your mind later
 with: dpkg-reconfigure ndi-runtime-installer
